# The A100 run's optional arm 5, A' (docs/HARDWARE.md, the optional arms), round 2 of 2: the box's pool at 32 sessions,
# the frozen engine and the PRs' values; the agents' sample of seed 10 + N. Voice alone, the SLO's reference, is the
# core's five points on this host (flatshare-bench e2 report reads arm 1 on the same hardware), so neither round repeats
# it. Round 1 starts on the frozen engine the run's previous block ended on, round 2 on the PRs' values round 1 ended
# on. On the A100 host:
#   FLATSHARE_NODE_DIR=flatshare/node flatshare/src/benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --local \
#     flatshare/src/benchmarks/a100/a100-aprime-r2.campaign

agents-seed 12

# engine make-room --additional-config.make_room.reserve_tokens 0 --additional-config.make_room.budget_cap_tokens 48
arms/a100-aprime-pr-ab48-s32.toml

# engine frozen
arms/a100-aprime-frozen-s32.toml
